    <summary>Arabic-first field sales and distribution management for Windows.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
FieldSales is a field sales and distribution (van sales / DSD) platform built Arabic-first for
Saudi Arabia and the Gulf.

Reps issue tax invoices from a phone with no connection at all, van stock is reconciled by item
against the morning load, visits are proven by location and photo, and collections are recorded
against specific invoices rather than as one lump sum.

This Windows application is the company admin console: customers, reps, catalogue, orders,
receipts and live reports. Subscription is per company rather than per user.

### Notes

* The app signs in against the hosted service at fieldsa.net — an account is required.
* Interface is Arabic; the platform also serves English, French, Turkish and Chinese.
]]></description>
